# UBSan suppressions for run-fuzzers: findings already triaged, so the
# fuzzers keep looking for new ones instead of stopping on these. Remove
# an entry once the bug is fixed upstream. Format: <check>:<function|file>.
# Inlined helpers have to be matched by file: UBSan matches the function
# name of the outermost (non-inlined) frame.
#
# No entries: the ip6_getbits() shift / out-of-bounds read previously listed
# here is fixed in lib/ip.h.
